// Stub valuesets — referenced by the CRL but not in source CQL.
// Some are codes-wrapped-as-1-element-valuesets (CRL convention since
// `coded from` requires a valueset); others are author-added composites
// the source CQL hadn't formalized. Empty URL = placeholder until proper
// VSAC mapping is added.

terminology "Body Mass Index Observations":
- valueset is ``.

// "Virtual Encounter Class" — source CQL uses the ActCode 'VR' code directly
// (not a valueset). Declared here as system+code terminology.
terminology "Virtual Encounter Class":
- system is `http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActCode`.
- code is `VR`.

terminology "Pregnancy Status":
- valueset is ``.

terminology "Follow Up for Above Normal BMI Procedures":
- valueset is ``.

terminology "Follow Up for Below Normal BMI Procedures":
- valueset is ``.


// ============ Runtime stubs ============
