// Kept as a stub asserted concept (coded from an empty stub valueset)
// until `parameter` declarations land (issues/crl/todo/parameters/).

terminology "Measurement Period (stub valueset)":
- valueset is ``.

concept "Measurement Period":
- type is Encounter.
- coded from "Measurement Period (stub valueset)".
